{
  "uid": "sol-search",
  "title": "Sol \u2014 B\u00fasqueda de actividades",
  "schemaVersion": 40,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Solicitudes por segundo",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(search_http_requests_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "Solicitudes por segundo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Errores HTTP del backend (%)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(search_http_requests_total{service_name=~\"$service\",outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(search_http_requests_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP 4xx/5xx"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Respuestas terminadas con HTTP 4xx/5xx. No incluye timeouts ni fallos de red observados por el cliente. Una solicitud abandonada antes de terminar la respuesta puede no registrarse aqu\u00ed."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Tiempo de respuesta p95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(search_http_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "Tiempo de respuesta p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "B\u00fasquedas completadas por segundo",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(search_completed_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "B\u00fasquedas completadas por segundo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Acceso a MongoDB p95 por operaci\u00f3n",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, operation) (rate(search_db_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Fallos observados por el cliente (%)",
      "description": "Intentos que fallan por timeout, HTTP, validaci\u00f3n, red o cancelaci\u00f3n. Incluye las solicitudes que no obtuvieron respuesta del backend. El porcentaje m\u00f3vil no equivale al porcentaje global del CSV.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(load_http_requests_total{service_name=\"sol-load-generator\",target_service_name=~\"$service\",phase=\"load\",outcome!=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(load_http_requests_total{service_name=\"sol-load-generator\",target_service_name=~\"$service\",phase=\"load\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "Fallos del cliente"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Timeouts del cliente por segundo",
      "description": "Venci\u00f3 el plazo del generador (15 segundos por defecto). No implica una respuesta HTTP 500. Sin generador o sin datos para el intervalo, el panel queda sin datos.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(load_http_requests_total{service_name=\"sol-load-generator\",target_service_name=~\"$service\",phase=\"load\",outcome=\"timeout\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "Timeouts/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Fallos del cliente por causa y por segundo",
      "description": "timeout: plazo vencido; http_error: respuesta distinta de 200; invalid_response: contenido inv\u00e1lido; network_error: conexi\u00f3n; aborted: cancelaci\u00f3n del experimento.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(load_http_requests_total{service_name=\"sol-load-generator\",target_service_name=~\"$service\",phase=\"load\",outcome!=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Duraci\u00f3n p95 observada por el cliente",
      "description": "Tiempo hasta terminar el intento en el generador, incluidos lectura del cuerpo, validaci\u00f3n y fallos. Los timeouts aportan su duraci\u00f3n real. Es una estimaci\u00f3n por buckets, diferente del percentil exacto del CSV.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(load_http_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"sol-load-generator\",target_service_name=~\"$service\",phase=\"load\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 del cliente"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Servicio backend",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(search_http_requests_total, service_name)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "sol-backend",
          "value": "sol-backend"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
